-**Agree** `.p2align N, fill` must be honoured (GAS
-`.byte 1; .p2align 3, 0xff; .byte 2` → `01ffffffffffffff02` in `.data` and
-`.text`). Fill is now parsed and applied; default NOP padding is unchanged.
